{
  "project": {
    "name": "Bias Tape Maker",
    "slug": "bias-tape-maker",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A 3D-printed folded-channel bias tape tool: a bias-cut strip feeds in the wide mouth, the tapering channel folds both raw edges to the centre, and single-fold tape comes out the throat under the iron. 18 mm and 25 mm modes, or any finished width you set.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Una herramienta para cinta al bies impresa en 3D: la tira al bies entra por la boca ancha, el canal cónico dobla ambos orillos hacia el centro y sale cinta de un doblez bajo la plancha. Modos de 18 y 25 mm, o cualquier ancho terminado.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/bias-tape-maker.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
